WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
Start with the task. Find the document.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.000
Test beyond the happy path. The test can write, too.

00:09.000 --> 00:13.500
Give the agent a smaller tool. Expose only the read.

00:13.500 --> 00:18.000
Test the boundary again. Read succeeds. Write is unavailable.
